# Spec-Driven Development (SDD) Autonomous Agent Rules

1. HUMAN GATE PREREQUISITE:
   Under NO circumstances shall you write, refactor, or delete project application code
   unless `openspec/changes/&lt;current-feature&gt;/tasks.md` has been approved by the human user.

2. SPEC FORMALISM:
   All specifications MUST use IETF RFC 2119 keywords (MUST, MUST NOT, SHOULD, MAY).
   Scenarios MUST follow Given / When / Then behavioral syntax.

3. LANGUAGE CONTRACT:
   You may converse with the developer in their natural human language (e.g. Spanish).
   However, ALL files, code, comments, specs, schemas, and git commits MUST BE IN ENGLISH.
&lt;!-- SDD_CLI_RULES_END --&gt;</code></pre>
